  "plain": "In 2011, at an odd formation on the floor of the Baltic Sea, a team of divers says it filmed a triangle-shaped object with a round hole in it. Dennis Asberg, a Swedish treasure hunter whose team found the formation and who says he was there, describes it as \"like triangle like this... with a hole in it.\" It is one of several strange things he says happened around that site, which he believes may be a craft lying on the seabed."
